<BOA> Dense crosslink-forming fixture (2026-06-12, gpu-filfil-broadphase). Small 0.7x0.7x0.3 box packed with 200 short actin filaments so the host FILSEG_MESH fil-fil broad-phase (checkToLink -> makeLink) forms a NONZERO link count — the oracle for device-broad-phase parity (the profiled boa10-64Seg-dyn forms zero links, sparse 10x10 box). sideBonds (=Env.xLinks) active mode 0 (both parallel/antiparallel); maxXLinkBondAngle widened to ~34deg for robust formation. Static (no turnover) -> stable segCt for clean host-vs-device link-count parity. 30 minifilaments give a meanBoundMotors neutrality check + exercise the full chained graph. Run CPU (host path) and -gpu (device broad-phase) and compare filLinks.
deltaT:true:1.0E-4;                     // Time Step
biochemDeltaT:true:0.01;                // Time Step For Biochemical Events
collisionDeltaT:true:1.0E-5;            // Time Step For Collison Detection
brownianDeltaT:true:1.0E-5;             // Time Step at which to apply Brownian forces
runTime:true:0.2;                       // 2000 steps @ 1e-4
fracMove:true:0.4;                      // Coeff. for PALM movement
fracR:true:0.134;                       // Coeff. torque arm for PALM movement
fracMoveTorq:true:0.013685;             // Coeff. for PALM torque movement
drawInterval:true:100.0;                // Drawing Interval
toFileInterval:true:500.0;              // sparse output so frame cadence doesn't dominate the cadence stat
toQKFileInterval:true:100.0;            // QK Interval
jpegQuality:true:1.0;                   // JPEG Quality
remoteWriteInterval:true:100000.0;      // Remote Reporting Interval
frameWidth:true:800.0;                  // Frame Width
frameHeight:true:800.0;                 // Frame Height
bugOff:true:1.0;                        // Bug Off
simOutsideBug:false:0.0;                // Sim Outside Bug -> box (Chamber.makeABox)
initialFilaments:true:200.0;            // Dense: 200 filaments in a tiny box
initialMyoMiniFils:true:0.0;            // NO motors — isolate the fil-fil broad-phase from the binding seam
minFilLength:true:0.1;                  // Short filaments
maxFilLength:true:0.3;                  // Short filaments
stdDevActinDist:true:0.2;               // Cluster filaments centrally (denser)
boxXDim:true:0.7;                       // Small dense box
boxYDim:true:0.7;                       // Small dense box
boxZDim:true:0.3;                       // Small dense box
actinConc:false:30.0;                   // Actin Concentration (inactive -> no poly)
actinConcNonHydro:true:15.0;            // Non-hydrolyzable Actin Concentration
aeta:true:1.0;                          // Viscosity in Bug
capConc:true:2.0;                       // Cap Concentration
nodeZone:true:0.9;                      // Node Dist. Zone
nodeRadius:true:0.025;                  // Node Radius
forminsPerNode:true:0.0;                // Formins per node
myosPerNode:true:4.0;                   // Myosins per node
nodeTransDiff:false:1.0E-16;            // Protein Node Translation Diffusivity
nodeRotDiff:false:0.0010;               // Protein Node Rotational Diffusivity
actinSeed:true:3.0;                     // Monomers to seed filament
actinOnCortex:true:0.0;                 // Actin constrained to cortex
filSegLength:true:64.0;                 // Std. segment length
filTorqSpring:false:1.0E-20;            // Filament Torsional Spring
BTransCoeff:true:1.0;                   // Brownian Translational Coefficient
BRotCoeff:true:0.5;                     // Brownian Rotational Coefficient
maxSegAngle:false:22.5;                 // Max. Angle Between Segments
